=2 Walkthrough
* Once you accept the assignment, you will -not- be provided with any supplies. You will receive {k:Hen. FS resource container} at the {p:Frontier Station}.
** **As of Feb 18, 2014 update, {p:Waypoints|Waypoint} can be used to complete this task. {k:Hen. FS resource container} will not break.**

+ Zone out to {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} from {z:Western Adoulin} at (C-9).
+ Run southwest and zone to {z:Sih Gates} around the border of (G-11)/(H-11) in {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds}.
+ Run south and zone to {z:Foret de Hennetiel} at (H-11).
+ From the entrance of {z:Foret de Hennetiel}, run a little ways into the first open area and take the south path to (J-7).
+ Speak to the {n:Station Administrator} at (J-7) to receive {k:Hen. FS resource container}.

* Return to the {n:Task Delegator} to deliver the supplies and receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* Movement speed increasing effects recommended.

